   "hash": "f6d674dcf8f9830f",
   "does": "On reconnect exhaustion during overnight streaming: if the H10 internal backup is recording, clears the flag and keeps streaming; otherwise pauses the night (saving buffered beats) in a Task and then clears the flag.",
